Purpose: 
~~~~~~~~
Shows a CPS report after a user downloads. See the Preview?.IFF piccy!


Requirements:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 - DayDream BBS 1.14+	(Any version really, I use 1.22)
 - HBasic2.library	(If you can't get a hold of it, EMail me!)


Installation:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
1)	Copy DD_CPS_#? to DOORS:



2)	Add the following line to your Download.gfx and Download.txt

	ÿDDoors:DD_CPS_Pre %N||

	You should put that line at the bottom of your ansi
	(use a text editor rather than ansi editor)




3)	Add the following line to your AfterDownload.gfx and AfterDownload.TXT

	ÿDDoors:DD_CPS_Post %N||

	Again, stick it at the end of your ansi (last line!)


Thats it! Enjoy...
